  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Summer is in swing here in the northern hemisphere, and, for many, that means more time outside. Exposure to the sun is important for producing vitamin D, but it also comes with some risks. The UV rays in sunlight are considered to be a complete carcinogen, meaning they can not only initiate cancer, but also promote its progression and spread. Visit this </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/skin-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to read more about skin cancer, and check out videos like </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-risks-and-benefits-of-sensible-sun-exposure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>The Risks and Benefits of Sensible Sun Exposure</b></a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/preventing-skin-cancer-from-the-inside-out/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Preventing Skin Cancer from the Inside Out</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Recipe: Cauliflower Alfredo Linguini</h4>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-scaled.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-87678 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/linguine-2-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>This recipe uses blended cauliflower to make a rich creamy sauce, giving you a dose of cruciferous veggies while foregoing the fat of heavy cream. It features roasted asparagus, but broccoli or leafy greens are other great options. Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/cauliflower-alfredo-linguine-with-roasted-asparagus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and go to our Instagram for a </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Cbvcn4XpsOj/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">video</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on how it’s made.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Double Your Donation</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-87680 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/matching-campaign-sq.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>One of our amazing supporters has agreed to match all donations up to a total of $20,000! Double your impact by making a gift to NutritionFacts.org by </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.app.neoncrm.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">supporting us here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> today.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Volunteer Spotlight: Jessica Collier</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-87676 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"262\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo.jpg 817w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo-768x1009.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo-720x946.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/jrc-photo-540x709.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>“In my volunteer role at NutritionFacts, I am a blog editor, which means that I turn raw text from Dr. Greger’s video transcripts into blog posts. I have been a volunteer for about five years, but time flies when you’re having fun. It’s great to be part of a community of people working to share science-based, life-changing nutrition information with the world. Because I come from a family who struggles with preventable health issues, this work is especially meaningful to me. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">My favorite recipe is the Chickpea and Cauliflower Curry from </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The How Not to Die Cookbook</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.”</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Volunteer Translators Needed</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-87684 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/vol-need-sq.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Our videos are viewed in nearly every country in the world, and each video on</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> NutritionFacts.org</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and YouTube has subtitles in English and many other languages. If you have a background in professional translation and would like to join our team of volunteers, please consider applying </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/translators/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(And check out </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4BwITF2uJvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">my message</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">!)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are especially seeking contributors for French, German, Russian, Spanish, and Vietnamese.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Get the Daily Dozen App</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-87674 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/dd-app-solid-bg.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>My Daily Dozen was created to help inspire you to incorporate the healthiest foods into your diet every day, and my app makes it easy to track! Visit our </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Dozen page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to download the free app and for more information, a how-to video, and an FAQ.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Top Three Videos</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-84870 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"top view of berry smoothies on a dark countertop\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-20-Foods-to-Help-Protect-Your-Arteries-from-Saturated-Fat.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/foods-to-help-protect-your-arteries-from-saturated-fat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Foods to Help Protect Your Arteries from Saturated Fat</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you’re going to have something unhealthy, is there anything you can eat with it to help mediate the damage it may cause?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-84878 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"close up shot of fresh lettuce\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-21-Natural-Dietary-Remedy-for-Insomnia.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/natural-dietary-remedy-for-insomnia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Natural Dietary Remedies for Insomnia</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Lactucin, the hypnotic component of lettuce, is put to the test in a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial of lettuce seeds. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-84987 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"an assortment of potassium-rich foods\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-23-fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intake.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/fewer-than-1-in-5000-meet-sodium-and-potassium-recommended-intakes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fewer Than 1 in 5,000 Meet Sodium and Potassium Recommended Intakes</span></a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nearly all Americans fail to get even the minimum recommended potassium intake or stay below the recommended sodium intake.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
